{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Immersive Sound Baths</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
<script defer src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</head>
<body class="glass-site">
<div class="bg-pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<header class="site-header">
<div class="container">
<a class="brand" href="index.html">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
<nav class="nav">
<a href="events.html">Events &amp; Calendar</a>
<a href="private-sessions.html">Private Offerings</a>
<a href="pricing.html">Investment</a>
<a href="about.html">Our Story</a>
<a href="faq.html">Q&amp;A</a>
<a href="book.html" class="primary">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
<a href="contact.html" class="muted">Connect</a>
</nav>
<button id="navToggle" aria-label="Toggle menu">☰</button>
</div>
</header>

<section class="hero ripple">
<div class="container hero-grid">
<div class="hero-copy">
<h1>Slow down. Sink into sound.</h1>
<p class="lead">{{TAGLINE}} — premium, sensory-led sound baths in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Next gathering: <strong id="nextEvent">{{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</strong>.</p>
<div class="hero-ctas">
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
<a class="btn btn-outline" href="events.html">See upcoming</a>
</div>
<ul class="quick-info">
<li>Facilitator: {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}</li>
<li>Venue: {{VENUE_NAME}}</li>
<li><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
<svg class="calm-graphic" viewBox="0 0 600 400" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">
<defs>
<linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#e6f7ff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#f7e6ff"/></linearGradient>
</defs>
<rect width="100%" height="100%" rx="18" fill="url(#g1)" opacity="0.9"/>
<g fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-opacity="0.35" stroke-width="2">
<path d="M20 300 C120 200 220 350 320 260 S520 140 580 220" />
<circle cx="140" cy="120" r="36" stroke-opacity="0.12"/>
<circle cx="420" cy="80" r="52" stroke-opacity="0.12"/>
</g>
</svg>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section id="social-proof" class="social-proof container">
<h2>Gatherings that linger — stories from guests</h2>
<div class="testimonials">
<blockquote>
<p>"A rich, tactile experience — I floated for hours after the session."</p>
<footer>— A. from {{CITY}}</footer>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>"The tone of the gong and tuning forks opened a new clarity. Facilitator held a clean, attentive space."</p>
<footer>— M. entrepreneur</footer>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
<p>"Luxurious and restorative — the setting felt like a private retreat."</p>
<footer>— K. yoga teacher</footer>
</blockquote>
</div>
</section>

<section id="benefits" class="benefits container glass-panel">
<h2>What you feel — the benefits</h2>
<p class="sub">A premium sensory arc designed to soothe nervous systems and invite spaciousness.</p>
<ul class="benefit-grid">
<li><strong>Deep relaxation</strong><span>Transition from doing to being through sustained harmonic fields.</span></li>
<li><strong>Clarity &amp; focus</strong><span>High-frequency tools like tuning forks recalibrate attention.</span></li>
<li><strong>Body release</strong><span>Vibrational massage with crystal bowls and a monochord supports somatic release.</span></li>
<li><strong>Restorative sleep</strong><span>Participants report improved sleep in the nights after sessions.</span></li>
</ul>
</section>

<section id="process" class="process container">
<h2>The flow — how a session unfolds</h2>
<p class="sub">We steward each moment with intention. Typical flow for group events and private VIP days:</p>
<ol class="process-steps">
<li><strong>Arrival &amp; grounding (10–15 min)</strong><span>Welcome, settling breathwork, orientation to the instruments.</span></li>
<li><strong>Opening tones (10 min)</strong><span>Warm-up with chimes and tuning forks to attune the room.</span></li>
<li><strong>Immersive soundscape (35–50 min)</strong><span>Layered bowls, gong, and voice create an enveloping field; slow transitions allow depth.</span></li>
<li><strong>Integration (10–20 min)</strong><span>Soft re-entry with monochord waves and gentle silence, followed by tea and optional sharing.</span></li>
</ol>
<div class="what-to-bring">
<h3>What to bring</h3>
<ul>
<li>Yoga mat or thick blanket, bolster or pillow.</li>
<li>Warm socks, eye mask, water bottle.</li>
<li>Optional: journal for after-session notes.</li>
</ul>
<p class="disclaimer"><strong>Contraindications:</strong> Not recommended during pregnancy without clearance, for those with recent head/inner-ear surgery, or uncontrolled epilepsy. If you use a pacemaker or have other electronic implants, check with your physician before booking.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section id="lead-magnet" class="lead-magnet container glass-panel">
<h2>Download: The Sound Bath Starter Guide</h2>
<p>Receive a concise guide to prepare for your first session and a checklist for a restorative at-home practice.</p>
<form id="leadForm" class="lead-form">
<label for="email">Email</label>
<input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required>
<button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Send me the guide</button>
<p class="form-note">We respect your inbox. VIP Day offers &amp; one-off emails only.</p>
</form>
</section>

<section id="faq" class="faq container">
<h2>Questions we often hear</h2>
<div class="qa">
<details><summary>How loud is a sound bath?</summary><div class="answer">It varies: most of the experience is gentle vibrations and sustained tones. The gong can be dynamic but is never uncomfortably loud; we tailor intensity to the group.</div></details>
<details><summary>Is there a dress code?</summary><div class="answer">Comfort-first: layered clothing that keeps you warm when lying still.</div></details>
<details><summary>Can I bring a friend?</summary><div class="answer">Yes — check events for group bookings or choose a private session for tailored experiences (1:1, couples, corporate).</div></details>
<details><summary>What if I have medical concerns?</summary><div class="answer">Please read contraindications above; contact us for a brief screening if in doubt.</div></details>
</div>
</section>

<section id="cta" class="final-cta glass-panel container">
<h2>Book a bespoke session — transform your day</h2>
<p>From single events to VIP Day intensives, we craft an immersive experience aligned with your needs.</p>
<div class="cta-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="contact.html">Request custom quote</a></div>
</section>

<footer class="site-footer container">
<div class="foot-grid">
<div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{VENUE_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
<div><a href="privacy.html" class="muted">Privacy</a> • <a href="faq.html" class="muted">FAQ</a></div>
<div>Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
</div>
<small>© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — All rights reserved.</small>
</footer>

<!-- Ripple overlay -->
<svg class="ripple-svg" id="ripple" viewBox="0 0 100 100" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
<defs><radialGradient id="rg" cx="50%" cy="50%"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity="0.08"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#fff" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs>
<circle cx="-20" cy="-20" r="100" fill="url(#rg)"></circle>
</svg>

</body>
</html>"} 
